@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram

autonumber
业务主流程 -> org.slf4j.Logger: log.info("日志")
org.slf4j.Logger -> ch.qos.logback.classic.Logger: log.info("日志")
ch.qos.logback.classic.Logger -> ch.qos.logback.core.spi.AppenderAttachableImpl:ch.qos.logback.classic.spi.LoggingEvent("日志")
ch.qos.logback.core.spi.AppenderAttachableImpl -> ch.qos.logback.core.AsyncAppenderBase:ch.qos.logback.classic.spi.LoggingEvent("日志")
ch.qos.logback.core.AsyncAppenderBase -> 缓存队列:ch.qos.logback.classic.spi.LoggingEvent("日志")
activate 缓存队列 #FFBBBB
autonumber stop
缓存队列 -> ch.qos.logback.core.AsyncAppenderBase
ch.qos.logback.core.AsyncAppenderBase -> ch.qos.logback.core.spi.AppenderAttachableImpl
ch.qos.logback.core.spi.AppenderAttachableImpl -> ch.qos.logback.classic.Logger
ch.qos.logback.classic.Logger -> org.slf4j.Logger
org.slf4j.Logger -> 业务主流程

autonumber
缓存队列 --> ch.qos.logback.core.AsyncAppenderBase.Worker:ch.qos.logback.classic.spi.LoggingEvent("日志")
ch.qos.logback.core.AsyncAppenderBase.Worker -> ch.qos.logback.core.FileAppender:ch.qos.logback.classic.spi.LoggingEvent("日志")
ch.qos.logback.core.FileAppender -> 文件输出流:日志字节流
文件输出流 --> 硬盘日志文件:异步输出流刷新
文件输出流 -> 硬盘日志文件:同步输出流刷新
autonumber stop
文件输出流 -> ch.qos.logback.core.FileAppender
ch.qos.logback.core.FileAppender -> ch.qos.logback.core.AsyncAppenderBase.Worker
ch.qos.logback.core.AsyncAppenderBase.Worker -> 缓存队列
deactivate 缓存队列
@enduml